<title>PHILIPPINES: Forum buys steel shares from Wing Tiek.</title>
<headline>Forum buys steel shares from Wing Tiek.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newly converted holding firm Forum Pacific Inc said on Thursday it had bought 15.750 million shares of National Steel Corp (NSC) from Wing Tiek Holdings Bhd.</p>
<p>The buy-in is estimated at 204.750 million pesos.</p>
<p>The acquisition gives Forum 3.0 to 5.0 percent stake in NSC, a Forum official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The investment is in line with the company's strategy to look for alternative investments with high earnings potential,&quot; Forum president Peter Salud told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>In October, Wing Tiek completed a deal with the Philippine government, buying 75 percent of National Steel Company which was then a state-owned company.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
